{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060915/block/singleImage/3251987/df/01M6361R70P9FPVB0GTGK61EEK.png?updatedAt=1793255927\"/><figcaption>香港仔漁業及海事分署外牆維修疑吊臂平台不穩，兩男女「半天吊」頭傷送院。(now新聞截圖)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (29 日 ) 上午 10 時 16 分，警方接獲保安報案，指石排灣道 100A 號漁業及海事分署發生工業意外，兩名工人進行外牆維修工作期間，意外跌出一吊臂車的工作平台，其後懸掛在空中。 救援人員趕到，發現該名 62 歲姓歐男工頭傷陷入半昏迷，而 57 歲姓羅女工則清醒，但頭傷及手腳擦傷，兩人被送往瑪麗醫院救治。案件列工業意外—有人意外受傷。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:02:26.949618+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":220,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T04:02:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T21:58:10.169240+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T06:59:07.474457+00:00","content_hash":"290edfe8e16718377f6a53cf73de4ecae418ca5ae0f82dd675f51ee8cf358a91","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:02:26.949618+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}